statement:
Find all lists $(x_1, x_2, \ldots, x_{2020})$ of non-negative real numbers such that the following three conditions are all satisfied:
\begin{itemize}
\item $x_1 \leq x_2 \leq \cdots \leq x_{2020}$;
\item $x_{2020} \leq x_1 + 1$;
\item there is a permutation $(y_1, y_2, \ldots, y_{2020})$ of $(x_1, x_2, \ldots, x_{2020})$ such that
\[
\sum_{i=1}^{2020} \bigl((x_i + 1)(y_i + 1)\bigr)^2 = 8\sum_{i=1}^{2020} x_i^3.
\]
\end{itemize}
